  "working_thesis": "The modern age, triggered by three major historical events and epitomized by Galileo's discovery of the Archimedean point and the resulting rise of universal science, has fundamentally altered the human condition through world alienation, earth alienation, and the dramatic reversal of the traditional hierarchical order between contemplation and action, ultimately culminating in the triumph of the animal laborans."
